cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this workflow, please cite the archived software release and the
  associated article.
title: Near-field seismo-acoustic analysis of the 2016 Falcon 9 AMOS-6 failure
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-21
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Thompson
    given-names: Glenn
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9173-0097
abstract: >-
  Python and Jupyter workflow for response correction, catalogue construction,
  array processing, acoustic and seismic amplitude measurement, coupling and
  energetics analysis, polarization analysis, multimedia synchronization, and
  figure generation for the 1 September 2016 Falcon 9 AMOS-6 static-fire
  failure recorded near Space Launch Complex 40.
keywords:
  - seismo-acoustics
  - infrasound
  - rocket explosion
  - Falcon 9
  - Jupyter
  - reproducible workflow
